  "reviewMatrix": {
    "architecture": "Extends existing public supplier page/API and existing proposal/state/event model. Client-safe contracts hold draft intent; domain service remains authoritative. No shell, ledger or module duplication.",
    "backend_api": "Strict bounded request body rejects injected scope and unsupported precision. Receipts expose bounded envelope/request/correlation references for exact recovery. Success and failure paths preserve private/no-store/no-referrer headers.",
    "database_migrations": "Existing Serializable transactions preserve proposal/state/event/access/audit atomicity. Real tests prove audit rollback, concurrent same-request convergence and revocation-after-read failure. No schema changes; immutable token and scope constraints left effective.",
    "security_iam_privacy": "Signed organization/envelope/PO/content scope and current active unexpired registry required. Effective permission is intersection of token and registry. Browser drafts fingerprint the token and do not store raw bearer values. Old in-flight responses cannot populate a newly selected envelope. Buyer transaction authority remains open.",
    "frontend_design_system": "Uses current product canvas/surface/raised/border/text/brand/attention tokens. Selection uses brand; selected does not mean accepted or approved. Native controls and line cards match established screen density. No shared shell replacement.",
    "workflow_accessibility_localization": "EN/FR labels, reasons, recovery, precision and confirmation. Native radio keyboard sequence, visible focus, receipt focus, preserved drafts, reduced-motion context, 320/390/768/1440 and CSS text enlargement verified in actual app. Native AT/zoom/contrast remain open.",
    "product_process": "Stops loss of supplier input and prevents silent quantity rounding. One confirmed response per invitation; exact recovery makes uncertainty actionable. Saved response explicitly awaits buyer review and does not change operations.",
    "finance_controls": "All original PO quantities/totals/approval/lines and global payment/journal hashes unchanged. No receiving, AP finalization, ledger posting, payment or reconciliation authority introduced.",
    "statutory_country": "Not applicable to rule changes: no country pack, tax, filing, payroll or statutory calculation modified. Supplier response is not statutory or signer approval.",
